WEBVTT

00:00:00.890 --> 00:00:03.150
Previously on Yu-Gi-Oh! VRAINS:

00:00:03.150 --> 00:00:08.750
Bro and I linked when he fought Bohman.

00:00:08.750 --> 00:00:11.890
That's when I became smart.

00:00:11.890 --> 00:00:16.830
I used to be happy because 
I didn’t know anything.

00:00:16.830 --> 00:00:19.120
You’re not happy right now?

00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:20.620
I'm happy.

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:25.200
But it’s a totally different 
happiness than yours, Soulburner.

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:29.440
It seems I underestimated Soulburner a bit.

00:00:29.440 --> 00:00:32.440
I'm fine stopping the duel.

00:00:32.440 --> 00:00:36.680
If you tell me where Ai is.

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:41.650
Bro showed me a new world.

00:00:41.650 --> 00:00:46.160
I'll repay his kindness by defeating 
the one who torments him!

00:00:46.160 --> 00:00:49.260
I’m tormenting Ai?

00:00:49.260 --> 00:00:52.190
If you protected Flame...

00:00:52.190 --> 00:00:55.200
...Bro wouldn’t have 
had to erase his friends.

00:00:55.200 --> 00:00:57.430
It’s your fault!

00:00:57.430 --> 00:01:01.540
I hate you for tormenting my Bro!

00:01:02.390 --> 00:01:11.660
calling & feeling  I take your 
thoughts to heart  VRAINS

00:01:30.250 --> 00:01:39.620
The data storm grazes my cheek, 
so I can't open my eyes

00:01:40.260 --> 00:01:49.570
What are we trying to find?  
Where are we trying to go?

00:01:50.130 --> 00:01:54.810
I won't make anyone sad anymore

00:01:55.140 --> 00:02:03.350
I'll retrieve you  Let's go and look ahead

00:02:03.610 --> 00:02:08.490
By meeting you, the world is in color

00:02:08.880 --> 00:02:14.160
I'll protect you with an unseen bond

00:02:14.460 --> 00:02:18.470
calling  With invisible wings

00:02:18.760 --> 00:02:29.080
Destroy the dark and weakness within me

00:02:36.630 --> 00:02:40.270
Do your best, Roboppi!

00:02:43.220 --> 00:02:45.300
Their LP are about equal.

00:02:45.300 --> 00:02:50.580
But looking at their fields, 
Roboppi has the advantage.

00:02:55.920 --> 00:02:58.750
I’ll become even more incredible.

00:02:58.750 --> 00:03:02.470
And conquer the universe!

00:03:04.800 --> 00:03:06.740
I feel good.

00:03:06.740 --> 00:03:10.730
I'll fuse with the universe.

00:03:11.440 --> 00:03:15.440
This feeling is a sign 
that I'll be incredible.

00:03:15.440 --> 00:03:20.610
I’ll defeat Soulburner 
and become more incredible!

00:03:20.610 --> 00:03:26.020
I don’t know what he’s talking about, 
but I can’t let it distract me.

00:03:26.020 --> 00:03:28.320
I only have a Field Spell on my field.

00:03:28.320 --> 00:03:31.940
If I don’t get my deck 
working, I’m in trouble.

00:03:32.620 --> 00:03:33.530
Here I go!

00:03:33.530 --> 00:03:36.120
My turn!  I draw!

00:03:37.160 --> 00:03:40.430
I summon Salamangreat Falco!

00:03:43.900 --> 00:03:46.570
I activate Spinny’s 
effect from my graveyard!

00:03:46.570 --> 00:03:48.470
I Special Summon it from the graveyard!

00:03:51.600 --> 00:03:52.920
Link Summon!

00:03:53.480 --> 00:03:59.320
Appear!  Link 2 Salamangreat Sunlight Wolf!

00:04:01.450 --> 00:04:05.190
I activate Falco's effect from the graveyard!

00:04:05.190 --> 00:04:08.690
I set Salamangreat Claw from the graveyard!

00:04:10.160 --> 00:04:14.320
Then I activate Jack Jaguar’s 
effect from my graveyard!

00:04:14.320 --> 00:04:17.380
I return Heatleo from my 
graveyard to my Extra Deck...

00:04:17.380 --> 00:04:20.670
...to Special Summon it next 
to Sunlight Wolf’s link!

00:04:23.980 --> 00:04:27.080
I activate Sunlight Wolf’s effect!

00:04:27.080 --> 00:04:29.910
I add Falco from my graveyard to my hand!

00:04:31.660 --> 00:04:34.620
You already rebuilt your formation.

00:04:34.620 --> 00:04:36.390
Link Summon!

00:04:37.360 --> 00:04:41.540
Link 1 Salamangreat Balelynx!

00:04:42.850 --> 00:04:45.060
Balelynx’s effect activates!

00:04:45.060 --> 00:04:48.580
I add Sanctuary from my deck to my hand!

00:04:48.580 --> 00:04:52.710
Appear!  The circuit that changes the future!

00:04:53.240 --> 00:04:57.580
The summoning conditions are at 
least two Fire Effect Monsters!

00:04:57.580 --> 00:04:59.210
Link Summon!

00:04:59.210 --> 00:05:03.260
Link 3 Salamangreat Heatleo!

00:05:03.920 --> 00:05:06.750
It's back again.

00:05:06.750 --> 00:05:09.450
Heatleo’s effect activates!

00:05:09.450 --> 00:05:11.890
Resounding Roar!

00:05:14.530 --> 00:05:19.440
The Field Spell, Salamangreat 
Sanctuary’s effect!

00:05:25.470 --> 00:05:27.890
Reincarnation Link Summon!

00:05:27.890 --> 00:05:31.940
Be reborn, Salamangreat Heatleo!

00:05:34.780 --> 00:05:37.040
Heatleo’s effect activates!

00:05:37.040 --> 00:05:39.620
Resounding Roar again!

00:05:44.190 --> 00:05:47.360
I activate the Equip 
Spell, Salamangreat Claw!

00:05:47.360 --> 00:05:49.650
I equip it on Heatleo!

00:05:50.330 --> 00:05:54.400
Now Heatleo can attack three times!

00:05:57.540 --> 00:06:00.540
Soulburner is incredible.

00:06:00.540 --> 00:06:03.860
He not only got rid of 
Roboppi’s set cards...

00:06:03.860 --> 00:06:08.010
...but he also used Salamangreat 
Claw to attack three times.

00:06:08.010 --> 00:06:09.450
Battle!

00:06:09.450 --> 00:06:12.920
Heatleo attacks Laundry Dragon!

00:06:13.750 --> 00:06:18.390
If these three attacks 
succeed, Soulburner wins.

00:06:20.370 --> 00:06:25.130
I’m not good enough to beat Soulburner!

00:06:25.130 --> 00:06:26.630
Just kidding.

00:06:26.630 --> 00:06:30.900
I’m smart now, so this 
isn’t enough to defeat me!

00:06:30.900 --> 00:06:35.340
I activate the Field Spell, 
Electrilyrical World’s effect!

00:06:40.150 --> 00:06:47.810
When you attack, I can move a Link 1 
Appliancer in the Main Monster Zone.

00:06:47.810 --> 00:06:51.120
I activate Celtopus’s effect!

00:06:51.120 --> 00:06:52.630
Octopus Charge!

00:06:56.090 --> 00:07:00.570
I didn’t know Electrilyrical 
World had that effect.

00:07:02.140 --> 00:07:04.610
This effect is my ace in the hole.

00:07:04.610 --> 00:07:07.490
I saved it until now.

00:07:07.490 --> 00:07:12.210
Strike back, Laundry Dragon!

00:07:13.780 --> 00:07:18.100
Laundry Dragon’s co-linked 
effect activates!

00:07:18.100 --> 00:07:20.300
Battle damage becomes 0!

00:07:20.300 --> 00:07:23.350
And the monster it battles is banished!

00:07:26.460 --> 00:07:29.190
Octopus Charge’s effect ends.

00:07:31.660 --> 00:07:34.670
I turned this whole thing around!

00:07:34.670 --> 00:07:36.190
No, not yet!

00:07:36.680 --> 00:07:38.460
Too bad, Roboppi.

00:07:38.460 --> 00:07:41.830
I also have a card in reserve!

00:07:41.830 --> 00:07:43.680
A card in reserve?

00:07:43.680 --> 00:07:47.680
Salamangreat Zebroid X’s effect 
activates from my graveyard!

00:07:47.680 --> 00:07:53.040
When your effect makes a Salamangreat 
Link Monster leave the field...

00:07:53.040 --> 00:07:55.600
...I can activate this 
card’s effect that turn!

00:07:55.600 --> 00:08:02.540
I can Special Summon this card and a Level 
4 Salamangreat by negating their effects!

00:08:06.770 --> 00:08:09.170
I’ve never seen that monster before.

00:08:09.170 --> 00:08:15.270
And I’ll use these two monsters 
to Xyz Summon a Salamangreat!

00:08:16.510 --> 00:08:18.980
Xyz Summon during battle?

00:08:18.980 --> 00:08:24.780
I use Level 4 Zebroid X and Jack 
Jaguar to build the Overlay Network!

00:08:31.360 --> 00:08:35.320
The scorching dragon that incinerates 
between the sky and sea!

00:08:35.320 --> 00:08:39.790
Become the flame of hope 
and show yourself now!

00:08:41.090 --> 00:08:43.170
Xyz Summon!

00:08:45.840 --> 00:08:51.410
Appear, Rank 4 Salamangreat Blaze Dragon!

00:08:53.810 --> 00:09:02.290
The Xyz Monster summoned using Zebroid X 
gains 300 ATK for each of its Overlay Units.

00:09:02.290 --> 00:09:05.290
So it gains 600 ATK!

00:09:07.030 --> 00:09:10.030
2900 ATK.

00:09:10.760 --> 00:09:15.700
This is Soulburner’s new Xyz Monster.

00:09:15.700 --> 00:09:20.310
Blaze Dragon attacks Laundry Dragon!

00:09:20.310 --> 00:09:25.280
I activate the Quick-Play Spell, 
Salamangreat Tail from my hand!

00:09:26.310 --> 00:09:33.750
A Salamangreat gains ATK equal to its 
DEF, and I regain that amount of LP!

00:09:35.960 --> 00:09:38.030
No mercy.

00:09:38.030 --> 00:09:43.260
He regained LP during battle and 
summoned a monster with 4100 ATK.

00:09:43.260 --> 00:09:45.260
Celtopus’s effect!

00:09:45.260 --> 00:09:47.040
Octopus Charge!

00:09:47.730 --> 00:09:52.500
But this attack will deal you 1600 damage.

00:09:52.500 --> 00:09:55.210
I win, Roboppi!

00:09:55.210 --> 00:10:01.250
Then I'll banish Appliancer Reduction 
from my graveyard to activate its effect!

00:10:01.250 --> 00:10:05.030
The battle damage I take is halved!

00:10:26.260 --> 00:10:28.270
I couldn’t finish him off.

00:10:28.270 --> 00:10:32.340
I set one card and end my turn!

00:10:34.020 --> 00:10:40.260
Now Salamangreat Tail's effect ends, and 
Blaze Dragon’s ATK return to normal!

00:10:45.600 --> 00:10:47.790
Not bad, Soulburner.

00:10:47.790 --> 00:10:51.760
But I have LP left.

00:10:51.760 --> 00:10:54.770
Huh?  His mood changed.

00:10:54.770 --> 00:10:58.740
What incredible dueling.

00:10:58.740 --> 00:11:05.710
Xyz Summon during battle?  
Maybe humans aren’t dumb.

00:11:05.710 --> 00:11:10.770
But I’ve grown more in this duel.

00:11:10.770 --> 00:11:15.270
I'm extremely smart now.

00:11:15.270 --> 00:11:18.770
I've surpassed all limits.

00:11:18.770 --> 00:11:22.290
I may have even surpassed my Bro!

00:11:24.960 --> 00:11:27.970
I feel really good.

00:11:31.380 --> 00:11:32.900
Roboppi…

00:11:37.140 --> 00:11:41.350
My turn!  I draw!

00:11:42.140 --> 00:11:45.320
I activate the spell card, Appliancer Test!

00:11:45.970 --> 00:11:49.270
I Special Summon Link 1 
Appliancers from my graveyard

00:11:49.270 --> 00:11:56.290
so that they're co-linked with an 
Appliancer in the Extra Monster Zone.

00:11:56.290 --> 00:12:02.530
I Special Summon Vacculephant and Propelion 
from my graveyard next to Celtopus’s link!

00:12:02.530 --> 00:12:08.160
When this effect Special Summons 
a monster, its ATK become 0.

00:12:09.010 --> 00:12:13.210
Vacculephant’s co-linked effect activates!

00:12:13.210 --> 00:12:18.180
I destroy one of your monsters 
in your Main Monster Zone!

00:12:20.440 --> 00:12:23.890
It’s over for your Blaze Dragon!

00:12:23.890 --> 00:12:25.400
It won’t work!

00:12:25.400 --> 00:12:28.860
When a battle or effect will 
destroy Blaze Dragon...

00:12:28.860 --> 00:12:33.330
...it can remove one Overlay Unit instead!

00:12:34.200 --> 00:12:38.270
I see.  It has that effect.

00:12:38.270 --> 00:12:45.310
But since it used an Overlay 
Unit, it loses 300 ATK!

00:12:47.780 --> 00:12:50.520
Appear, circuit!

00:12:50.520 --> 00:12:52.360
Link Summon!

00:12:52.360 --> 00:12:55.710
Link 1 Laundry Dragon!

00:12:57.590 --> 00:13:02.060
Electrilyrical World’s effect activates!

00:13:02.060 --> 00:13:05.480
I return Copybokkle from 
my graveyard to my hand.

00:13:06.640 --> 00:13:09.300
Then I Link Summon!

00:13:11.270 --> 00:13:16.930
Appear, Link 1 Appliancer Dryer Drake!

00:13:18.010 --> 00:13:23.140
When Dryer Drake is co-linked, 
it gains 1000 ATK.

00:13:23.980 --> 00:13:29.690
Now there are two monsters 
co-linked with Celtopus.

00:13:31.060 --> 00:13:35.430
So all monsters gain 2000 ATK.

00:13:35.430 --> 00:13:36.980
That’s right!

00:13:36.980 --> 00:13:40.830
Laundry Dragon attacks Blaze Dragon!

00:13:40.830 --> 00:13:42.830
Celtopus’s effect!

00:13:42.830 --> 00:13:45.570
Octopus Charge!

00:13:45.570 --> 00:13:50.240
Laundry Dragon, destroy Blaze Dragon!

00:13:50.240 --> 00:13:51.870
I won’t let you!

00:13:51.870 --> 00:13:56.250
I send a Salamangreat spell or 
trap in my hand to the graveyard!

00:13:56.250 --> 00:14:00.360
I activate the Continuous 
Trap, Salamangreat Ring!

00:14:00.360 --> 00:14:05.120
With this card, Salamangreats gain 
500 ATK and aren’t affected

00:14:05.120 --> 00:14:07.370
by your monsters’ effects!

00:14:08.130 --> 00:14:14.050
But that’s not enough against 
Laundry Dragon’s ATK!

00:14:18.970 --> 00:14:24.830
If Blaze Dragon will be destroyed, 
I can use an Overlay Unit instead!

00:14:26.240 --> 00:14:31.680
But Blaze Dragon’s ATK decreases even more!

00:14:31.680 --> 00:14:35.860
Dryer Drake attacks Blaze Dragon!

00:14:35.860 --> 00:14:37.760
Octopus Charge!

00:14:40.100 --> 00:14:43.060
Blaze Dragon will no longer be a nuisance!

00:14:43.540 --> 00:14:45.230
Wrong!

00:14:45.230 --> 00:14:47.370
Blaze Dragon’s effect activates!

00:14:47.370 --> 00:14:51.300
When it's attacked while 
it has no Overlay Units...

00:14:51.300 --> 00:14:57.170
...I can stack a Salamangreat from my Extra 
Deck with this monster to Xyz Summon!

00:14:57.170 --> 00:14:58.610
What?

00:14:58.610 --> 00:15:04.580
I rebuild the Overlay 
Network with Blaze Dragon!

00:15:05.920 --> 00:15:08.390
Reincarnation Xyz Summon!

00:15:08.970 --> 00:15:13.480
Be reborn!  Salamangreat Blaze Dragon!

00:15:16.360 --> 00:15:22.070
He's tough.  Even his Xyz reincarnated.

00:15:22.070 --> 00:15:27.510
Due to Salamangreat Ring’s 
effect, it gains 500 ATK!

00:15:27.510 --> 00:15:30.740
The reincarnated Blaze 
Dragon’s effect activates!

00:15:30.740 --> 00:15:36.750
When Blaze Dragon is used to reincarnate, 
one of your monsters is destroyed!

00:15:36.750 --> 00:15:39.520
I destroy Laundry Dragon!

00:15:41.070 --> 00:15:48.230
If Laundry Dragon is destroyed, Dryer 
Drake’s ATK will be lower than Blaze Dragon’s ATK.

00:15:51.570 --> 00:15:54.680
You keep using annoying effects!

00:15:54.680 --> 00:15:57.700
But they won't work!

00:15:57.700 --> 00:16:01.940
I activate Appliancer Coating’s 
effect from my graveyard!

00:16:01.940 --> 00:16:06.940
When an effect destroys and sends an 
Appliancer Link Monster to the graveyard...

00:16:06.940 --> 00:16:11.740
...I can Special Summon it 
so that it’s co-linked.

00:16:11.740 --> 00:16:15.380
Resurrect, Laundry Dragon!

00:16:17.120 --> 00:16:18.410
What?

00:16:18.410 --> 00:16:23.860
I banish Balelynx and Appliancer 
Coating from my graveyard!

00:16:26.080 --> 00:16:29.020
Now I can battle again!

00:16:29.020 --> 00:16:32.800
Dryer Drake attacks Blaze Dragon!

00:16:32.800 --> 00:16:34.770
Celtopus’s effect!

00:16:34.770 --> 00:16:36.720
Octopus Charge!

00:16:43.650 --> 00:16:48.520
I use Blaze Dragon’s Overlay 
Unit so it won't be destroyed!

00:16:50.650 --> 00:16:55.740
But I still have monsters left!

00:16:55.740 --> 00:16:59.630
Laundry Dragon attacks Blaze Dragon!

00:17:03.070 --> 00:17:04.890
Celtopus’s effect!

00:17:04.890 --> 00:17:09.610
I'll pummel you!  Octopus Charge!

00:17:18.740 --> 00:17:21.800
But I managed to survive!

00:17:22.960 --> 00:17:26.990
Underestimating me is what makes you human.

00:17:26.990 --> 00:17:29.990
I’m an AI that'll conquer the universe.

00:17:29.990 --> 00:17:34.290
This isn't enough to stop me!

00:17:35.330 --> 00:17:40.040
Dryer Drake’s co-linked effect activates!

00:17:40.040 --> 00:17:47.010
During battle, it switches places with a 
Link 1 Appliancer in the Main Monster Zone.

00:17:47.010 --> 00:17:51.420
And the monster that switched 
places can attack twice.

00:17:52.120 --> 00:17:56.990
So Laundry Dragon can attack again!

00:17:58.090 --> 00:18:02.960
I have no ways left to stop 
Laundry Dragon’s attack.

00:18:06.430 --> 00:18:12.940
Everyone has trouble against 
Soulburner, but he’s easy for me!

00:18:12.940 --> 00:18:18.140
In my current state, I can 
even defeat my Bro easily!

00:18:21.150 --> 00:18:27.020
I’m the savior of LINK VRAINS!

00:18:27.020 --> 00:18:35.090
I’m the one who'll save the AI’s future.

00:18:35.090 --> 00:18:38.410
Something’s wrong.

00:18:38.410 --> 00:18:43.180
I’m a savior.  I’m the universe.

00:18:43.180 --> 00:18:44.300
I win.

00:18:44.300 --> 00:18:50.310
I…  I…  I…  am… am… am…

00:18:51.280 --> 00:18:54.770
It’s over for Soulburner.

00:18:54.770 --> 00:18:56.520
And over for me.

00:18:56.520 --> 00:18:58.680
I end my turn.

00:18:58.680 --> 00:19:01.850
What?  You end your turn?

00:19:03.860 --> 00:19:06.700
I'll conquer the universe.

00:19:06.700 --> 00:19:09.900
Everyone who opposes me will be finished.

00:19:09.900 --> 00:19:13.860
I'll do a major cleaning of the universe!

00:19:15.250 --> 00:19:20.300
Clean…  Clean…  A major cleaning-

00:19:27.140 --> 00:19:29.580
What’s going on?

00:19:29.580 --> 00:19:34.020
Roboppi’s AI is a housework AI.

00:19:34.020 --> 00:19:37.720
It couldn’t withstand my system.

00:19:39.330 --> 00:19:41.960
That means Roboppi is…

00:19:44.960 --> 00:19:50.940
Clean.  I have... to clean.

00:19:50.940 --> 00:19:54.910
I have to hurry up and clean.

00:19:54.910 --> 00:19:59.740
I must return to my 
master’s room and clean.

00:20:01.440 --> 00:20:06.840
That's when I'm most happy.

00:20:06.840 --> 00:20:14.100
Master’s room holds many 
happy memories for me.

00:20:17.730 --> 00:20:21.070
Soulburner…  Please take care of this.

00:20:25.820 --> 00:20:28.810
My turn!  I draw!

00:20:30.650 --> 00:20:34.780
I activate the Equip Spell, Rising Fire!

00:20:34.780 --> 00:20:41.450
When there are no monsters on my field, I can 
Special Summon a Fire monster from my graveyard.

00:20:41.450 --> 00:20:44.460
Resurrect, Heatleo.

00:20:45.390 --> 00:20:46.590
Battle.

00:20:46.590 --> 00:20:50.210
Heatleo attacks Dryer Drake.

00:20:53.600 --> 00:20:57.630
Roboppi, you were dumb.

00:20:58.300 --> 00:21:03.650
Dumb…  Dumb is a forbidden word.

00:21:06.420 --> 00:21:09.110
That’s a beautiful light.

00:21:09.110 --> 00:21:14.180
I'm happy to be able to see this.

00:21:23.060 --> 00:21:24.720
Roboppi…

00:21:25.800 --> 00:21:30.570
Roboppi, you were a good guy.

00:21:31.390 --> 00:21:36.570
Sorry to get you involved in this.  Bye.

00:21:46.960 --> 00:21:48.590
What’s that?

00:21:53.260 --> 00:21:57.830
Is this a clue to Ai's whereabouts?

00:22:05.490 --> 00:22:09.460
I was told repeatedly

00:22:09.460 --> 00:22:16.910
Only tales of dreams

00:22:17.260 --> 00:22:23.880
Is my life precious?

00:22:24.140 --> 00:22:26.870
Make up for  Make up for

00:22:27.240 --> 00:22:34.380
The next sentimental

00:22:39.220 --> 00:22:45.640
I'm not a machine

00:22:48.360 --> 00:22:52.080
I cry a single tear

00:22:53.570 --> 00:22:57.300
A single answer moves me

00:22:58.470 --> 00:23:07.660
We helplessly sing for someone we can't reach

00:23:08.280 --> 00:23:13.090
Are you ready?

00:23:13.590 --> 00:23:18.440
Oh oh oh

00:23:18.960 --> 00:23:23.660
Are you ready?

00:23:24.260 --> 00:23:30.750
Are you ready?

00:23:37.840 --> 00:23:41.800
I'll deal with the Dark Ignis.

00:23:42.470 --> 00:23:47.740
Varis suddenly intervenes, 
angering Soulburner.

00:23:47.740 --> 00:23:54.950
To end their destiny, their 
duel will finally take place.

